# Blog posts and uploaded blog images are generated live on the server by
# backend/blog-admin — content, not code. insights.html itself stays
# tracked (it starts as the "coming soon" placeholder) but will diverge
# from git once real posts are published; that's expected, see
# backend/blog-admin/README.md.
/blog/*.html
/assets/blog/*
!/assets/blog/.gitkeep
